{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to <strong>WISHLIST</strong>\u00a0on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fat Goblins</strong>, where chaos, chubbiness, and class based combat come together in the form of 16v16 giant castle battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team based combat with up to 32 friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don different hats to launch fireballs, heal teammates, shoot arrows, or just slice your way through the enemy team!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breach the walls and rescue your pudgy princess from the clutches of the enemy castle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatten up your captive royal with delicious meat you scavenge from your teammates &amp; enemies corpses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/1cef2b28f00e1410b4bec8ff001c4266.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/1cef2b28f00e1410b4bec8ff001c4266.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/1cef2b28f00e1410b4bec8ff001c4266.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win games to upgrade your runes and create the best hat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/31be38d789961cf0beb71a5a15b82c6c.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/31be38d789961cf0beb71a5a15b82c6c.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/31be38d789961cf0beb71a5a15b82c6c.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine abilities with teammates to create powerful combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/860e723caeaf740a5cd43dc237846495.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/860e723caeaf740a5cd43dc237846495.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/860e723caeaf740a5cd43dc237846495.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2450350?t=1760735921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2450350?t=1760735921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/bbb39268fc3b2aeced1d246d931dbb2d08924fa2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760735921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/bbb39268fc3b2aeced1d246d931dbb2d08924fa2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760735921","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is cartoony and fun in style, but it contains a lot of (goblin) blood! Whenever a goblin takes damage, their cartoony blood stains the ground for a period of time before fading. There is a setting that allows you to change the color of the goblin blood."},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/b4fc80561367ab605fc7fc61257097e8.avif?t=1760735921\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community <strong>Discord</strong> to engage with us during the development process! We'll also announce <strong>playtests</strong> and <strong>latest news</strong> here!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to <strong>WISHLIST</strong>\u00a0on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fat Goblins</strong>, where chaos, chubbiness, and class based combat come together in the form of 16v16 giant castle battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team based combat with up to 32 friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don different hats to launch fireballs, heal teammates, shoot arrows, or just slice your way through the enemy team!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breach the walls and rescue your pudgy princess from the clutches of the enemy castle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.poster.avif?t=1760735921\" width=540 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.webm?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.mp4?t=1760735921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatten up your captive royal with delicious meat you scavenge from your teammates &amp; enemies corpses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragra